From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yewsifofficial <yewsifofficial@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 23:35:45 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] net: online play through Nextendo Network for Super Smash
 Bros. Ultimate

With DM_NEXTENDO=1 the host takes Super Smash Bros. Ultimate 13.0.5 online
through Nextendo Network, a community server: nn::socket on the host's
sockets, nifm online, Nintendo's names resolved to Nextendo's servers, a
Nextendo account (OAuth 2.0 + PKCE, Keychain) as the network service
account, and the game's NEX login carried to the game server through a
pinned TLS bridge. Off, and for every other game, the offline answers are
unchanged. Written from sm35recomp's and WindowSmash's published designs;
not yet built with Xcode or run (docs/nextendo.md).

Upstream-Status: fork-only (online play is out of nxnative's scope)
Reason: Nextendo Network online play, first for Super Smash Bros. Ultimate
Issue: yewsiff/NX2Apple (no tracker: issues are disabled on this fork)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017xdHQoEipBX2wTqN8BNnMv
