+# Online play through Nextendo Network (dm/host/net_online.h, docs/nextendo.md): observation gate OBS_NEX_LOGIN (27) on the entry of NEX's login job step that works out the game
+# server's address (main+0x249190; the job in x0, its NgsFacade at +360), where the host gives the facade a direct server address: its own TLS bridge. The offset and the layout are
