+// Online (net_online.h: DM_NEXTENDO=1 and a game the host takes online): nifm reports the network, the socket calls below reach the host's own sockets
+// (the on_* functions further down), names resolve to Nextendo's servers, and the game's NEX login goes through the TLS bridge. Every hook checks
+// dm_net_online() first, so every other game keeps the offline answers exactly.
